Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 05:05:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] FeatureGate: save rules to /data/system with AtomicFile

FeatureGateStore writes rules as binary XML (with a version attribute)
using AtomicFile, so a crash mid-write never corrupts the file. Writes
are debounced (500 ms) and run on IoThread from a snapshot taken under
the lock. /data/system is available before user unlock (Direct Boot).

Change-Id: Icc440ed2eb69877720457d629bb2dde212a8b6ec
